巴佩的球迷怎么看？一场街头采访如同一面镜子，映照出他们如何看待世界，又如何认识自己。 https://t.co/iRTEY8wnNU","url":"https://x.com/VOAChinese/status/2115271147507863799"},{"author_id":"1503362006191026180","created_at":"2026-10-28T02:33:24.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115270679717388388"],"id":"2115270679717388388","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":11050,"like_count":21,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":19,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"1838163946064535610","type":"quoted"}],"text":"与以太坊基金会有过资金关联的 $ETH 远古巨鲸，时隔一年再次抛售 7594.33 ETH，成本不高于 11 美金😲\n\n该地址 7 小时前将价值 1777 万美元的 ETH 充值进了 #Kraken，若卖出将获利至少 1770 万美元；他曾在 2016 年收到 RSS 合约分发的 242,653 枚，上次充值还是上轮牛市时，本次充值后链上已清仓 https://t.co/aFzDjVQGyU https://t.co/zgSXpwHw25","url":"https://x.com/ai_9684xtpa/status/2115270679717388388"},{"author_id":"121908437","created_at":"2026-10-28T02:31:13.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115270128426434595"],"id":"2115270128426434595","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":7096,"like_count":19,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":14,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我的「X 机器人回复判定」的已经判定了 177 个 AI 回复的账号了，我二次确认过，基本上都判断的很正确。\n\n接下去，我准备让 Grok Bot 不需要我确认，直接自动屏蔽这些 AI 回复了。 https://t.co/GoJbuj8ItA","url":"https://x.com/tualatrix/status/2115270128426434595"},{"author_id":"46574977","created_at":"2026-10-28T02:30:14.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115269883403386958"],"id":"2115269883403386958","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":12236,"like_count":8,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":4},"text":"周二，以色列选民以创纪录的人数参加投票。初步出口民调显示，无论是内塔尼亚胡及其盟党，还是反对派，都未能获得足够席位。截至目前仍未出现明确的胜出方，凸显出以色列社会的深刻分歧，也预示着选举结果可能在较长时间内仍难以明朗。https://t.co/leLMxUULJ5","url":"https://x.com/ChineseWSJ/status/2115269883403386958"},{"author_id":"620632841","created_at":"2026-10-28T02:30:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115269824024600676"],"id":"2115269824024600676","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":19,"impression_count":58937,"like_count":166,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":23,"retweet_count":11},"text":"“国家队”救市不灵了？中国股市颓势折射经济困境。中国大陆股市较近期高点下跌超过20%，已达到熊市的临界点。股市抛售反映出人们对经济更深层次的担忧，以及对政策制定者是否采取了足够刺激措施的质疑。https://t.co/oPqmtNTN95","url":"https://x.com/nytchinese/status/2115269824024600676"},{"author_id":"1400012445154889731","created_at":"2026-10-28T02:21:28.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115267674431500715"],"id":"2115267674431500715","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":180,"impression_count":156122,"like_count":638,"quote_count":6,"reply_count":86,"retweet_count":64},"text":"这就是天朝，徽剑遇害案，最惊悚的地方在于，境外只是发布 30 万元人民币悬赏，便有位河南年轻人接单了，随后他把价格抬高到 100 万元，摇来了十多位参与者，一起完成了绑架，最终将人殴打致死。\n\n官方文书直接击碎了所有侥幸，字字见血：\n  \n1. https://t.co/Cho9xBUNSV","url":"https://x.com/DtDt666/status/2115267674431500715"},{"author_id":"1239457591417171973","created_at":"2026-10-28T02:20:43.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115267486790648173"],"id":"2115267486790648173","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":26,"impression_count":44096,"like_count":935,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":63,"retweet_count":12},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2115048534995042652","type":"quoted"}],"text":"当你在 @KMbappe 姆巴佩的评论区说了一句实话belike 👇🐸 https://t.co/hSAMtJLNev https://t.co/psIUz6rcVb","url":"https://x.com/GFWfrog/status/2115267486790648173"},{"author_id":"1154174763918606339","created_at":"2026-10-28T02:20:32.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115267439801913485"],"id":"2115267439801913485","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":12,"impression_count":5544,"like_count":23,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":2},"text":"美国“穷人”实际生活状态，是你想象的样子吗（科普版）\n\n很多人印象中的美国穷人是“身无分文、住破房子、吃了上顿没下顿、生病只能等死”。\n\n这个画面几乎不存在，很多街头流浪汉都是自找的，拒绝接受救助\n\n更典型的美国低收入群体是这样的：","url":"https://x.com/maoshen/status/2115267439801913485"},{"author_id":"1260553941714186241","created_at":"2026-10-28T02:20:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115267306272289200"],"id":"2115267306272289200","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":44,"impression_count":53143,"like_count":206,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":20,"retweet_count":13},"text":"10月27日，网友发帖曝光，某地银行内部推行“为母亲而战”绩效考核，要求员工签署《我的十日承诺书》。\n\n承诺书内容包括：承诺10天净增余额数额、填写最想为之努力的人，并要求将“母亲（家人）照片贴在荣誉墙或战旗上”。 https://t.co/IMNGUL6LyS","url":"https://x.com/whyyoutouzhele/status/2115267306272289200"},{"author_id":"1154174763918606339","created_at":"2026-10-28T02:14:16.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115265863284572600"],"id":"2115265863284572600","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3026,"like_count":7,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2115151531398004895","type":"quoted"}],"text":"菜篮子工程的伟大，跟“9块9包邮”的伟大一样\n\n本质上不是你技术有多高，而是你成本压得够低\n\n靠极限压榨底层民众的收入，来实现你的伟大\n\n你吃的不是便宜菜，是底层民众的血泪😢 https://t.co/w9aVFyViL3","url":"https://x.com/maoshen/status/2115265863284572600"},{"author_id":"1499656309565657089","created_at":"2026-10-28T02:13:59.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115265794074726723"],"id":"2115265794074726723","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":10558,"like_count":29,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":29,"retweet_count":1},"text":"现在其实已经比较少敢通过借贷上杠杆去做多 ETH 的巨鲸/机构了 (被清算的例子太多)，下面这个已经是近期最大的那个：\n\n他在最近一个月时间里通过循环贷从 Aave 借了 3100 万 U 购买了 21,895 枚 ETH ($5463 万)，购买均价约 $2,495。\n仓位的清算价格的话，在 $1,660。\n\n地址：https://t.co/5ccBBbGM3X https://t.co/hLYxwlvygm","url":"https://x.com/EmberCN/status/2115265794074726723"},{"author_id":"3178231","created_at":"2026-10-28T02:08:46.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115264482377159071"],"id":"2115264482377159071","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":29,"impression_count":31083,"like_count":106,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":34,"retweet_count":4},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2115188124875702767","type":"quoted"}],"text":"咦，Jenny 这是从 Anthropic 跳到了 xAI 了，接替了 Ryo Lu 的位置 https://t.co/nfsNnCp9E2","url":"https://x.com/dotey/status/2115264482377159071"},{"author_id":"39941478","created_at":"2026-10-28T02:02:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115262794148798482"],"id":"2115262794148798482","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":9061,"like_count":14,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":1},"text":"印度尼西亚和马来西亚今年以来累计开展逾百次